WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.269
On a number chart, check the size of a jump. Moving right or forward adds; moving

00:00:05.269 --> 00:00:06.536
left or backward subtracts.

00:00:07.367 --> 00:00:18.716
What is 1 more than 9,955? The answer is 9,956. 9,955 plus 1 equals 9,956.

00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:25.730
A chart on a football field lists steps of 1. The highlighted box is 49,827; what

00:00:25.730 --> 00:00:29.603
number is immediately after it? Pause the video and think.

00:00:30.450 --> 00:00:39.723
A chart on a football field lists steps of 1. The highlighted box is 49,827; what

00:00:39.723 --> 00:00:47.837
number is immediately after it? The answer is 49,828. 49,827 plus 1 equals 49,828.
